<title>USA: Commonwealth Bancorp to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth Bancorp to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NORRISTOWN, Pa. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday that its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 900,000 shares, or approximately 5 percent, of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Repurchases are authorized to be made by the Company from time to time in open market transactions during the next six months as, in the opinion of management, market conditions warrant, the company said.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be reserved for issuance pursuant to the Company's stock option plans, the company said.</p>
</text>
